y, until you discover a more exciting perspective.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/quadphos", "videos": [{"id": 153838, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gTfNTGIDNZ8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gTfNTGIDNZ8", "title": "Quadphos - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gTfNTGIDNZ8/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}